description:
For an international organization, we are urgently looking for a Full Remote Senior ServiceNow AI Engineer to accelerate AI Journey.










 We are looking for a contractor, who is able to work full\\-time in CET working hours. Candidates need to be fluent in English.










**Tasks and Responsibilities:** 



* Lead the design, development, and delivery of AI\\-powered solutions on the ServiceNow platform, leveraging capabilities such as Build Agent, Now Assist, Generative AI, AI Agents, and related technologies;
* Remain hands\\-on in solution architecture, design reviews, technical problem solving, proof of concepts, and complex AI implementations;
* Identify opportunities to embed AI capabilities across business processes, workflows, and platform services to maximize business value;
* Evaluate emerging ServiceNow AI capabilities and industry trends, providing recommendations on how they can be applied within the organization;
* Clear communicator and problem solver;









**Profile:** 



* Bachelor or Master degree;
* 5 years of experience working with the ServiceNow platform, including solution design, development, platform engineering, or architecture roles;
* Strong hands\\-on experience with ServiceNow AI capabilities, particularly in designing, configuring, and implementing solutions using Now Assist and/or agentic AI capabilities;
* Hands\\-on experience in ServiceNow Build Agent, IDE and Fluent developments;
* Fluent in English;
